ir mother is eaten alive. Eren vows that he will murder every single titan and take revenge for all of mankind.<br><br>\\r\\n(Source: MangaHelpers)", "mainStudios": {"nodes": [{"name": "WIT STUDIO", "isAnimationStudio": true}]}, "averageScore": 85, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "recommendations": {"nodes": [{"rating": 2913, "mediaRecommendation": {"id": 101348, "title": {"native": "ヴィンランド・サガ", "romaji": "VINLAND SAGA", "english": "Vinland Saga"}, "format": "TV", "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Drama"], "status": "FINISHED", "isAdult": false, "episodes": 24, "meanScore": 87, "startDate": {"year": 2019}, "coverImage": {"color": "#f16b5d", "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101348-2fhDFPCuMNiz.jpg", "extraLarge": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101348-2fhDFPCuMNiz.jpg"}, "popularity": 557179, "bannerImage": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101348-pivKKffCAwAY.jpg", "averageScore": 87}}, {"rating": 705, "mediaRecommendation": {"id": 101759, "title": {"native": "約束のネバーランド", "romaji": "Yakusoku no Neverland", "english": "The Promised Neverland"}, "format": "TV", "genres": ["Drama", "Fantasy", "Horror", "Mystery", "Psychological", "Thriller"], "status": "FINISHED", "isAdult": false, "episodes": 12, "meanScore": 83, "startDate": {"year": 2019}, "coverImage": {"color": "#e4ae50", "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101759-8UR7r9MNVpz2.jpg", "extraLarge": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101759-8UR7r9MNVpz2.jpg"}, "popularity": 641160, "bannerImage": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101759-MhlCoeqnODso.jpg", "averageScore": 83}}, {"rating": 383, "mediaRecommendation": {"id": 116589, "title": {"native": "86－エイティシックス－", "romaji": "86: Eighty Six", "english": "86 EIGHTY-SIX"}, "format": "TV", "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Mecha", "Sci-Fi"], "status": "FINISHED", "isAdult": false, "episodes